{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011Cgi1Nkm7f5pwFCrmjd7r7","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The full suite now runs clean against the final build: 130 passed, 0 failed across 11 suites, including the story playthrough, drills, attract, dev, the browser checks and the AI Hub harness in all four configurations. Before this, the full suite had last run before the final edit to the `usage` text.\n\nI also overstated how much was cut. The organ in the game already uses a custom drawbar wave with vibrato (harmonics 1, 2, 3, 4, 6, 8), and the goal horn uses detuned sawtooth voices through a lowpass filter. What genuinely differs from PLAN.md, and what TASK.md does not require, is that no brass-wave oscillator was added to the engine. Skating, stick handling and goalie moves also use the engine's stock rig gaits and poses, not custom `solvePose` overrides. The sticks, pads and numbers are drawn over the rig by the game rather than added to the rig itself.\n\nI still have not looked at fight, replay, flood-wagon or KABOOM screenshots; those systems are covered by the headless tests only.\n\n`IceHoc-Kaboom-IceHockey-claude-sonnet-5-5-medium-20261104-055058.html` and `exit-interview.json` are in the work folder root, and `exit-interview.json` parses with every field filled. The four feedback sections (Source Information, Testing Feedback, Engine Feedback, Prompt Feedback) are unchanged from my previous reply."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":156,"cache_read_input_tokens":526489,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":156},"output_tokens":478,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"de63938e-b4cc-4b63-8e8c-4cc91a6c7b2f","uuid":"6