{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Stop hook feedback:\n[Read STAGE.md in the current folder and do what it says (TASK.md describes the game). Done when: the bundled single .html file exists in this folder's root, every feature in TASK.md is implemented with no TODOs, placeholders or stubs, exit-interview.json in this folder's root parses as JSON and answers every field, and your final reply contains the Source Information, Testing Feedback, Engine Feedback and Prompt Feedback sections.]: The deliverables exist and the four feedback sections appear in the final reply. But the transcript does not establish that every TASK.md feature is implemented and verified. The last message says the skating lean was the only gap closed, and that stock poses cover the rest of the motion set. It also says the Overhead camera and stopping were not looked at, and that stopping and overhead views were not checked. Earlier messages concede that the custom solvePose layer from PLAN.md was not built, and that several screens were checked only by test counts and a few screenshots. The 130/0 suite shows logic passing, not verified completion of every TASK.md feature."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"de63938e-b4cc-4b63-8e8c-4cc91a6c7b2f","uuid":"2c5ece51-9838-4d23-b4d5-5e9a9bf8a49b","timestamp":"2026-11-04T14:24:28.114Z","isSynthetic":true}
